---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Terms and Conditions | GlobalsBlog"
	description="Read the GlobalsBlog Terms and Conditions covering website use, content rights, external links, and general limitations of liability."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Terms and Conditions</p>
			<h1>The basic terms that apply when using GlobalsBlog.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				By accessing or using GlobalsBlog, visitors agree to use the website lawfully and in a
				way that does not harm the site, its content, or other users.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-grid">
			<article class="content-card">
				<h2>Use of the website</h2>
				<ul class="content-list">
					<li>Content is provided for general information and reading purposes</li>
					<li>Users must not misuse the site, interfere with operations, or attempt unauthorized access</li>
					<li>We may update, remove, or revise content and site features at any time</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Intellectual property</h2>
				<p>
					Unless otherwise stated, website content, branding, layout, and original published
					material on GlobalsBlog are the property of the site or its licensors and should not be
					reproduced without permission.
				</p>

				<h2>External links</h2>
				<p>
					Some pages may link to third-party websites for reference or convenience. GlobalsBlog
					is not responsible for the content, policies, or availability of those external sites.
				</p>

				<h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog does not guarantee uninterrupted access, error-free publishing, or the
					completeness of every article at all times. Use of the site is at the visitor’s own
					discretion.
				</p>
			</article>

			<aside class="content-card content-card-accent">
				<h2>Policy updates</h2>
				<p>
					These terms may be updated when the website, business, or legal requirements change.
					Continued use of the website after updates means acceptance of the revised terms.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact details</h2>
				<p>
					Questions about these terms can be sent to
					<a href="mailto:contact@globalsblog.com">contact@globalsblog.com</a>.
				</p>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
